### ------------------------------------------------------------
### ORGANIZER APPLICATION (requires Authorization)
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### Apply as organizer
POST {{baseUrl}}/organizer-applications
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "institutionData": {
    "name": "Hüpftag Niefern",
    "description": "Kinder Aktivitäten",
    "address": "Niefern, Germany",
    "phone": "+491234567890",
    "website": "https://malhaus-niefern.de",
    "category": "Kinder"
  },
  "message": "Ich organisiere seit 3 Jahren Veranstaltungen für Kinder."
}


### Get my organizer applications
GET {{baseUrl}}/organizer-applications/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### INSTITUTION (requires Authorization + role: organizer)
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### Get my institution
GET {{baseUrl}}/institutions/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Update my institution
PUT {{baseUrl}}/institutions/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hüpftag Niefern",
  "description": "Aktualisierte Beschreibung",
  "address": "Niefern, Germany",
  "phone": "+491234567890",
  "website": "https://malhaus-niefern.de",
  "category": "Kinder"
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### ORGANIZER APPLICATIONS (admin) - requires role: admin
### Login above must be an admin user so {{accessToken}} works here
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### List organizer applications (e.g. ?page=1&limit=10 or ?filter[status]=pending)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/organizer-applications
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Get single organizer application by id
@organizerApplicationId = 6a666e09104a80874e01e9dd
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/organizer-applications/{{organizerApplicationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Approve organizer application (creates Institution + sets user role to organizer)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/organizer-applications/{{organizerApplicationId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Reject organizer application (rejectedReason required, min 3 chars)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/organizer-applications/{{organizerApplicationId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rejectedReason": "Unterlagen unvollständig"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### SOCIAL POSTS (requires Authorization — run login first)
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### Create post (minimal)
# @name createPost
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "text": "Today's park event was amazing!"
}


### Create post (with optional fields)
# @name createPostFull
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "text": "A short note after yoga.",
  "city": "Berlin",
  "placeName": "Tiergarten",
  "location": {
    "lat": 52.5145,
    "lng": 13.3501
  },
  "eventId": "6a674100175ec34cf6c7250f",
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/post-image.jpg"
}


### List posts (feed — newest first)
# @name listPosts
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Read post by id (increments viewCount)
# @name readPost
@postId = 6a6f2daa0e713a567279f84c
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Update post (owner or admin)
# @name updatePost
PUT {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "text": "Updated post text after the event."
}


### Toggle like on post
# @name likePost
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}/like
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Delete post (soft delete — owner or admin)
# @name deletePost
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### SOCIAL POST COMMENTS (requires Authorization — run login first)
### 1) Login  2) Create/read post (sets {{postId}})  3) List / create comment
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### List comments for a post
# @name listComments
GET {{baseUrl}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Create top-level comment
# Once createPost / readPost calistir — {{postId}} ayni olmali
# @name createComment
POST {{baseUrl}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "postId": "{{postId}}",
  "text": "Great post, thanks for sharingg!"
}


### Create reply to a top-level comment
# @name createCommentReply
@parentCommentId = {{createComment.response.body.$.comment._id}}
POST {{baseUrl}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "postId": "{{postId}}",
  "text": "Totally agree!",
  "parentCommentId": "{{parentCommentId}}"
}


### Update comment (owner or admin)
# @name updateComment
@commentId = {{createComment.response.body.$.comment._id}}
PUT {{baseUrl}}/comments/{{commentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "text": "Edited: Great post, thanks for sharing!"
}


### Toggle like on comment
# @name likeComment
POST {{baseUrl}}/comments/{{commentId}}/like
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Delete comment (soft delete — owner or admin)
# @name deleteComment
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/comments/{{commentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

